<title>USA: CCC buys 13,000 tonnes soyoil for Peru.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 13,000 tonnes soyoil for Peru.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it had bought 13,000 tonnes of crude degummed soybean oil for export to Peru.</p>
<p>The purchase comprised 5,000 tonnes from Bunge Corp at $512.13 a tonne, 2,000 tonnes from Cargill Inc at $509.92, 3,000 tonnes from Cargill Inc at $511.91, 1,000 tonnes from ADM at $510.98, 1,000 tonnes from ADM at $511.97 and 1,000 tonnes from ADM at $512.79.</p>
<p>All the oil was FOB New Orleans.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for December 14-30.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
